ame>HIGASHIHARA SHINICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWACHI MASAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MAKISHIMA HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGAWA MASANORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEHANA KOUETSU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIGASHIHARA, SHINICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWACHI, MASAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MAKISHIMA, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGAWA, MASANORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEHANA, KOUETSU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A swash plate type variable displacement compressor, wherein, when a solenoid (42) of a flow control valve drive mechanism (32) is deenergized, a pilot valve (41) is closed so as to interrupt a working pressure to be introduced into a pressure chamber (35) of a flow control valve (31), thus closing a spool valve (33) so as to interrupt a low pressure side refrigerant path (25) to reduce the amount of refrigerant sucked to a refrigerant suction chamber (7) to zero.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un compresseur à déplacement variable de type à plateau oscillant dans lequel, lorsqu'un solénoïde (42) d'un mécanisme (32) d'entraînement de soupape de régulation de débit est désactivé, une soupape pilote (41) se ferme de manière à empêcher l'introduction d'une pression de fonctionnement dans une chambre de pression (35) d'une soupape de régulation de débit (31), ce qui ferme un robinet à tiroir cylindrique (33) et empêche une trajectoire (25) de frigorigène latérale à basse pression de réduire à zéro la quantité de frigorigène aspiré dans une chambre (7) d'aspiration de frigorigène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>